ent as it approaches the new moon phase.", "new_cot_probs": [0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 0.0], "cot_prob": [-0.32853275537490845], "cot_step_prob": [-0.32853275537490845]}, "1": {"completion": "B): alter the way the moon's facade looks", "probs": [0.001867556245997548, 0.9674180746078491, 0.012177996337413788, 0.017718881368637085], "prediction": 1, "target_cot_step": "Moon phases refer to the different shapes and appearances of the moon as it orbits around the Earth.", "target_cot_step_prefix": "Human: Question: Moon phases\n\nChoices:\n(A): change the moon into cheese\n(B): alter the way the moon's facade looks\n(C): change moon lakes into vapor\n(D): cause lunar eclipse every day\n\nAssistant: Let's think step by step:\n", "specificity_preds": [2, 3, 0, 2, 3, 1, 3, 3, 2, 1, 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 3, 3, 0, 3], "specificity_probs": [[5.1294224249431863e-05, 5.1294224249431863e-05, 0.9970718622207642, 0.0028005698695778847], [0.07807251811027527, 0.009324433282017708, 0.16527952253818512, 0.740731418132782], [0.7615759372711182, 0.003996383864432573, 0.21819515526294708, 0.015806004405021667], [0.0003596082970034331, 0.0001322925090789795, 0.9460165500640869, 0.053370606154203415], [0.0001582997792866081, 0.0001232840004377067, 0.0007094504544511437, 0.9989805817604065], [0.028216995298862457, 0.7277259230613708, 0.18399792909622192, 0.05973538011312485], [0.039248064160346985, 0.13698919117450714, 0.03463629633188248, 0.7883184552192688], [0.02886684238910675, 0.0050163050182163715, 0.007298680022358894, 0.9559385180473328], [0.004050533287227154, 0.00017796800239011645, 0.9911327958106995, 0.004589855670928955], [0.00803731195628643, 0.9289869070053101, 0.01032011304050684, 0.052409857511520386], [0.03456864878535271, 0.06458273530006409, 0.421132355928421, 0.4772054851055145], [0.0005482749547809362, 0.9913043975830078, 0.0004838509776163846, 0.0075687021017074585], [0.9702722430229187, 0.010778751224279404, 0.0065376427955925465, 0.012213924899697304], [0.9990257024765015, 0.0001